    "preamble": "P Ramesh Babu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 26 June, 2025 In The High Court Of Andhra Pradesh At Amaravati` .,r' ttJ Thursday, The Twenty Sixth Day Of June, ll^/o Thousand And Twenty Five I/ :PRESENT: THE HONOURABLE DF` JUSTICE Y. LAKSHIV]ANA RAO CRIMINAL PETITION NO: 5984 OF 2025 Betwee n : p.Ramesh Babu, S/o Ad'lnarayanappa, Aged 36 years, Hindu, Cultivation, Residing at Kirikera, Hindupur Manda].",
    "facts": "During the operation, a male indivI'dual found in possession of a white polythene bag attempted to flee but was apprehended by the staff. On questionI-ng, he admitted that the bag contained liquor bottles. Upon verification, 48 pet bottles of suspected spurI|OuS Tropicana VSOP Brandy (180 mI) were found. The individual was I'dentified as Ashok Kumar/Accused No.1, aged 32 years, S/o Erragadla +<` i== Lakshminarasappa, a resident of chalivendula village. He disclosed that he had purchased the bottles from one Mahesh at Rs.100/- each and was reselling them for Rs.110. The labels on the bottles lacked standard identifiers such as Holograms and FSSAI numbers, and bore inconsistent printing, leading to the identification of the stock as spurious. one sample bottle was drawn, sealed, and labeled for chemical analysis.",
    "arguments": "4. Sri N.Ranga Reddy, learned counsel for the Petitioner, Submits that the petitioner has not committed any offence and he was falsely 'lmplicated in this case. He is the sole breadwinner Of his family. He has got fixed abode.",
